###

### 1. Listar todos los conductores
GET {{base}}/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Obtener conductor por ID
GET {{base}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Crear conductor
POST {{base}}/conductores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Nicolas Tamayo",
    "cedula": "1011084879",
    "licencia": "LIC-001",
    "telefono": "3213250592",
    "estado": "disponible"
