###

### 4. Actualizar conductor
PUT {{base}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Carlos A. Ramírez",
    "telefono": "3009999999"
}

###

### 5. Cambiar estado
PATCH {{base}}/conductores/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "estado": "en_ruta"
}

###

### 6. Eliminar conductor
DELETE {{base}}/conductores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}